# Redirect rules for Cloudflare Workers Static Assets.
#
# The local preview container DERIVES its copy: scripts/gen-ops.ts generates
# nginx.conf's redirect locations from this file — run `pnpm gen:ops` after
# editing here. CI (container-parity) fails on drift, so the mirror cannot
# silently rot.
#
# The bare domain and the /001 short URL redirect at the HTTP layer so crawlers
# and link tools see a real 30x instead of a 200 meta-refresh stub. The stubs
# in src/pages/index.astro and 001.astro remain as a defence-in-depth fallback.
#
# `/` stays a 302 until edge language negotiation decides the final story
# (ADR-0004 / Phase 3); /001 is the permanent brand short URL.
/     /nl      302
/001  /nl/001  301

# The deployed brand kit was renamed to mirror the masters in docs/brand/ (one
# name per file, so `brand-assets.py --deploy` is a pure copy). These three
# paths are already out in the world — press-page links, and the compact mark
# is an <img src> in every e-mail signature pasted from the template — so they
# keep resolving. The founding-pack pixel logo has no successor: it is a
# different mark the brand guide forbids pairing with the ratified one, so it
# points at the horizontal lockup, which is what "primary logo" now means.
/brand/twente-dev-mark.svg   /brand/mark.svg                   301
/brand/twente-dev-mark.png   /brand/png/mark-512.png           301
/brand/twente-dev-logo.png   /brand/png/lockup-horizontal-512.png  301
